Z||000000||Tigger||02-12-2001||10:23 AM||||I remember a few members on the forum were looking for trailer hitches for their Fiero.  <P>Going through the Ebay list just now I came across a few, so I did a search, and found at least 10 of them up for bid!  Looks like a bolt-on install and are made for one of those lightweight mini trailers to put your extra stuff or cooler on for long trips.<P>Anyway, I don't know the guy selling or making them, just informing those who might be interested.||||reg||1
Z||000001||Phil||02-12-2001||10:33 AM||||Fiero Store sells them $150.||||reg||1
Z||000002||FieroJoe||02-12-2001||10:33 AM||||I saw those too, a whole bunch of them.  They look exactly the same as the ones that the Fiero Store is selling.<P>------------------<BR>FieroJoe<BR>c311t@yahoo.com<BR>AIM: Fiero87311, Snowboarder0311<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/profile_1.JPG"> ||||reg||1
